## Python Instruction
Write a python function to find the kth smallest element in a given list using QuickSelect algorithm.

## Python Solution
```python
def partition(arr, low, high):
    i = (low-1)
    pivot = arr[high]

    for j in range(low, high):
        if arr[j] <= pivot:
            i = i+1
            arr[i], arr[j] = arr[j], arr[i]

    arr[i+1], arr[high] = arr[high], arr[i+1]
    return (i+1)

def quickSelect(arr, low, high, k):
    if (k > 0 and k <= high - low + 1):
        index = partition(arr, low, high)

        if (index - low == k-1):
            return arr[index]
        if (index - low > k-1):
            return quickSelect(arr, low, index-1, k)

        return quickSelect(arr, index+1, high, k-index+low-1)

def kth_smallest_element(arr, k):
    return quickSelect(arr, 0, len(arr)-1, k)
```

